OL,4,BAlonso to drive in Dakar Rally for     
OL,5,BAston Martin                           
OL,6,GTwo-time Formula 1 world champion      
OL,7,GFernando Alonso will lead Aston        
OL,8,GMartin's attempt to win the Dakar      
OL,9,GRally in January 2027.                 
OL,11,FThe 45-year-old Spaniard, who drives   
OL,12,Ffor the British team in Formula 1,     
OL,13,Fpreviously contested the prestigious   
OL,14,Frally raid event in 2020 for Toyota.   
OL,16,FAston Martin have struggled in the     
OL,17,Ffirst year of F1's new regulations in  
OL,18,Fthe Adrian Newey-designed AMR26 car.   
